OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, clear start with frost
OL,6,Fin places. Dry and settled through the
OL,7,Fday for most with patchy cloud
OL,8,Fdeveloping. The odd light shower
OL,9,Fpossible around northern and western
OL,10,Fcoasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry and settled overnight
OL,13,Fwith light winds and lengthy clear
OL,14,Fspells. Turning cold again, with a
OL,15,Ffrost developing across many inland
OL,16,Fareas by morning. Turning breezy for
OL,17,Fthe Outer Hebrides.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
