OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAnother cold start with an
OL,6,Finland frost. Largely sunny through
OL,7,Fthe day, but turning cloudier and
OL,8,Fwindier across the Western Isles
OL,9,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCold
OL,12,Fand bright on Monday with a good deal
OL,13,Fof sunshine. Turning unsettled on
OL,14,FTuesday and Wednesday with cloud and
OL,15,Frain at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
